  "body": "Discover the perfect blend of modern and easy living at its finest. \r\n\r\nThis lovely, recently renovated one-bedroom,home is set back from the road. Facing north, this red brick and tile villa is positioned perfectly for the sun, which floods the open-plan dining/kitchen area in the morning and moves through the high windows in the raking ceiling throughout the day.\r\n\r\nThe floor plan is very efficient, with no wasted space in long hallways. Those stunning high ceilings lend a bright airy feeling to the living areas.\r\n\r\nSet in a prime location, immerse yourself in the vibrant coastal lifestyle Orewa has to offer with its beautiful beaches, cosy cafes, and boutique shops. Take leisurely strolls along the sandy shores, indulge in a variety of activities the area has to offer, or simply enjoy the breathtaking sunsets that this coastal haven is renowned for. This home offers an unparalleled lifestyle opportunity.\r\n\r\nContact Lance to arrange a private viewing and discover for yourself all that's on offer.\r\n\r\nPurchase is under a licence to Occupy Agreement",
